WEBVTT

00:22.503 --> 00:22.864
Hmm.

01:04.820 --> 01:09.763
The pier found us at the hotel The fortress fell,

01:11.184 --> 01:16.487
the sanctuaries breached A frantic call, a

01:16.547 --> 01:21.610
bug-out plan A safe house just outside her reach

01:25.192 --> 01:29.895
The convoy rolled, the silence set

01:38.608 --> 01:40.169
To hide instead

01:46.253 --> 01:51.056
A childhood room, a tiny space In an accessible,

01:51.376 --> 01:57.167
cramped place The doorway is too narrow I can't

01:57.207 --> 02:00.329
get through the bathroom door Fall upon the

02:00.389 --> 02:03.550
hardwood floor My spirit feeling bruised and

02:03.670 --> 02:08.172
sore It's a hell of inconvenience

02:10.013 --> 02:16.135
A fragile temporary defense But I am safe here,

02:16.536 --> 02:20.918
hiding out I kill the fear, I kill the doubt This

02:21.378 --> 02:23.259
is the blue water bunker

02:29.955 --> 02:31.535
My safe person

02:34.176 --> 02:35.856
You'll see me through

02:57.381 --> 03:01.987
The nights are long, the bed is small I lie awake,

03:03.548 --> 03:08.153
I'm terrified Of what's to come with nowhere

03:08.213 --> 03:11.716
left to hide The cord is looming dark and deep I

03:11.776 --> 03:18.142
cannot rest, I cannot sleep It's a hell of

03:18.222 --> 03:19.444
inconvenience

03:21.265 --> 03:27.320
A fragile temporary defense But I am safe here,

03:27.701 --> 03:32.064
hiding out I kill the fear, I kill the doubt This

03:32.324 --> 03:41.211
is the blue water bunker And I am here with you My

03:41.291 --> 03:42.512
safe person

03:45.154 --> 03:46.735
You'll see me through

04:06.443 --> 04:10.025
But in the dark you take my hand You're the one

04:10.125 --> 04:14.187
who'll understand You and Aubrey here with me My

04:14.307 --> 04:17.769
anchor's in this angry sea The house is small,

04:17.829 --> 04:21.911
the fear is real But your love is what I feel

04:24.992 --> 04:28.674
Safe

04:29.155 --> 04:35.538
In the blue water bunker Safe

